# File: .dockerignore
# History: Version 0.2, October 17, 2026
# Program: Exclude local-only and generated files from the Docker build context.
# Input: Paths relative to the repository root.
# Processing: Omit Git metadata, virtual environments, local generated data, and caches.
# Output: A smaller and safer Docker build context.

.git
.venv
node_modules
web-components/node_modules
data/generated
data/analysis
data/state
*.sqlite3
__pycache__
